{
  "slug": "insight-badger",
  "name": "Insight Badger",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Drop a CSV and get meaningful, actionable data insights — no formulas or coding required, even no questions needed. Autonomous exploratory analysis and guided investigation, delivered as polished interactive reports.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `dig-deep` (Perform fully automated exploratory analysis on a survey-response CSV with no prior guidance), `dig-for` (Perform guided survey analysis when the user has a direction but needs help articulating it).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install insight-badger@claude-community` from `ozturkumut/insightbadger-plugin`.",
